# 📘 SacoStayAPI

## 🏗 Project Architecture

Project được xây dựng theo mô hình:

Controller → Service → GenericRepository → DbContext → Database

### 🔹 Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Responsibility |
|-------|---------------|
| Controller | Nhận HTTP request và trả response |
| Service | Xử lý business logic |
| Repository | Giao tiếp với database |
| DbContext | Quản lý Entity Framework |
| Entity | Đại diện bảng trong database |

---

# 📂 Project Structure

```
📁 Data
   └── ApplicationDBContext.cs

📁 Entities
   └── YourEntity.cs

📁 Repositories
   ├── IGenericRepository.cs
   └── GenericRepository.cs

📁 Services
   ├── IYourService.cs
   └── YourService.cs

📁 Controllers
   └── YourController.cs

📄 Program.cs
```

---

# 🚀 How To Create A New API

---

## 🧱 STEP 1 – Create Entity

📁 `Entities/YourEntity.cs`

```csharp
public class YourEntity
{
    public int Id { get; set; }

    public string Name { get; set; }

    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; } = DateTime.UtcNow;
}
```

---

## 🧱 STEP 2 – Add DbSet to DbContext

📁 `ApplicationDBContext.cs`

```csharp
public DbSet<YourEntity> YourEntities { get; set; }
```

Run migration:

```bash
add-migration AddYourEntity
update-database
```

---

## 🧱 STEP 3 – Create Service Interface

📁 `Services/IYourService.cs`

```csharp
public interface IYourService
{
    Task<IEnumerable<YourEntity>> GetAllAsync();
    Task<YourEntity?> GetByIdAsync(int id);
    Task CreateAsync(YourEntity entity);
    Task UpdateAsync(int id, YourEntity entity);
    Task DeleteAsync(int id);
}
```

---

## 🧱 STEP 4 – Implement Service

📁 `Services/YourService.cs`

```csharp
public class YourService : IYourService
{
    private readonly IGenericRepository<YourEntity> _repo;
    private readonly ApplicationDBContext _context;

    public YourService(
        IGenericRepository<YourEntity> repo,
        ApplicationDBContext context)
    {
        _repo = repo;
        _context = context;
    }

    public async Task<IEnumerable<YourEntity>> GetAllAsync()
    {
        return await _repo.GetAllAsync();
    }

    public async Task<YourEntity?> GetByIdAsync(int id)
    {
        return await _repo.GetByIdAsync(id);
    }

    public async Task CreateAsync(YourEntity entity)
    {
        await _repo.AddAsync(entity);
        await _context.SaveChangesAsync();
    }

    public async Task UpdateAsync(int id, YourEntity entity)
    {
        var existing = await _repo.GetByIdAsync(id);
        if (existing == null) return;

        existing.Name = entity.Name;

        _repo.Update(existing);
        await _context.SaveChangesAsync();
    }

    public async Task DeleteAsync(int id)
    {
        var existing = await _repo.GetByIdAsync(id);
        if (existing == null) return;

        _repo.Remove(existing);
        await _context.SaveChangesAsync();
    }
}
```

⚠ Important:  
GenericRepository không gọi `SaveChangesAsync()` nên phải gọi trong Service.

---

## 🧱 STEP 5 – Create Controller

📁 `Controllers/YourController.cs`

```csharp
[ApiController]
[Route("api/[controller]")]
public class YourController : ControllerBase
{
    private readonly IYourService _service;

    public YourController(IYourService service)
    {
        _service = service;
    }

    [HttpGet]
    public async Task<IActionResult> GetAll()
    {
        var data = await _service.GetAllAsync();
        return Ok(data);
    }

    [HttpGet("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> GetById(int id)
    {
        var data = await _service.GetByIdAsync(id);

        if (data == null)
            return NotFound();

        return Ok(data);
    }

    [HttpPost]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Create(YourEntity entity)
    {
        await _service.CreateAsync(entity);
        return Ok("Created successfully");
    }

    [HttpPut("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Update(int id, YourEntity entity)
    {
        await _service.UpdateAsync(id, entity);
        return Ok("Updated successfully");
    }

    [HttpDelete("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Delete(int id)
    {
        await _service.DeleteAsync(id);
        return Ok("Deleted successfully");
    }
}
```

---

## 🧱 STEP 6 – Register Dependency Injection

📁 `Program.cs`

```csharp
builder.Services.AddScoped(typeof(IGenericRepository<>), typeof(GenericRepository<>));
builder.Services.AddScoped<IYourService, YourService>();
```

---

# 📌 API Naming Convention

| Action | HTTP Method | Route |
|--------|------------|-------|
| Get All | GET | /api/entity |
| Get By Id | GET | /api/entity/{id} |
| Create | POST | /api/entity |
| Update | PUT | /api/entity/{id} |
| Delete | DELETE | /api/entity/{id} |

---

# 🔥 Development Rules

- Không viết business logic trong Controller
- Không gọi DbContext trực tiếp trong Controller
- Service xử lý toàn bộ nghiệp vụ
- Repository chỉ giao tiếp database
- SaveChanges phải được gọi trong Service
- Tên API theo RESTful convention

---

# 🧠 API Flow Diagram

```
Client
   ↓
Controller
   ↓
Service
   ↓
GenericRepository<T>
   ↓
DbContext
   ↓
Database
```

---

# ✅ Development Checklist

Khi tạo API mới, thực hiện:

- [ ] Tạo Entity
- [ ] Thêm DbSet vào DbContext
- [ ] Tạo Service Interface
- [ ] Implement Service
- [ ] Tạo Controller
- [ ] Đăng ký DI
- [ ] Migration & Update Database
- [ ] Test bằng Swagger

